# The exported ABI, pinned. dpkg-gensymbols compares the built library
# against this list and fails the build when they disagree, which is what
# turns "exactly six symbols" from a wish into a build-time guarantee.
#
# An accidental export shows up here as a new symbol and fails. A removed
# one fails too. Either way the fix is a deliberate decision about the
# soname rather than a surprise for whoever linked against 1.0.
libadxl345.so.1 libadxl345-1 #MINVER#
 adxl_close@Base 1.0.0
 adxl_open@Base 1.0.0
 adxl_read@Base 1.0.0
 adxl_start@Base 1.0.0
 adxl_stop@Base 1.0.0
 adxl_version@Base 1.0.0
